      <h1 style="margin-top:10px">Who should control the club-night rotation?</h1>
      <p class="lede">A pegboard gives control to the queue. A good organiser keeps it in one person's head. Self-selection gives it to the players. Software puts policy into code. The trade-off is not old versus new - it is where you want judgement to live.</p>
      <div class="guide-meta">
        <span class="gm-tag">Comparison</span>
        <span>Club nights</span>
        <span>10 min read</span>
      </div>
    </div>
